# This package is its own pub project root, so it owns its build/dependency
# ignores — same rule the repo-root .gitignore states for web-app/, mobile/
# and desktop/. Everything below is regenerated by `flutter pub get` and
# `flutter test`; committing it means every test run dirties the tree.
#
# This package is the worst offender: the sqlite3 native-assets hook writes
# .lock files and a platform-specific libsqlite3.dylib under .dart_tool/ and
# build/ on every test run, so a macOS build would otherwise commit binaries
# that CI (ubuntu) can neither use nor reproduce.

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
/.dart_tool/
/build/
/coverage/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
